(there be any such victims living in France or Germany, in Holland or) Tj T*
(Belgium, or Scandinavia, they are very slow in disclosing themselves to) Tj T*
(the various international conferences held for their benefit. They are) Tj T*
(very backward in coming forward.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
