(countrymen are of this class, _i. e._, of the creditor class. I take it) Tj T*
(that we are not legislating specially for bankrupts. Certainly it would) Tj T*
(not be wise to change our standard of value for their accommodation.) Tj T*
(Such a change would produce a great many new bankrupts and would not) Tj T*
(save any old ones.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
